      "body_html": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n  <h3>New Lead Assignment</h3>\n  <p>Hi <strong>{{agent.name}}</strong>, a new enquiry has been assigned to you.</p>\n  <p><strong>Name:</strong> {{contact.name}}<br><strong>Phone:</strong> {{contact.phone}}<br><strong>Email:</strong> {{contact.email}}</p>\n  <p><a href=\"{{contact.crm_url}}\" style=\"background: #0D9488; color: white; padding: 10px 18px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;\">Open Record in Calling Workspace</a></p>\n</div>",
